review:
  plan: planning/plans/PLAN-thinking-gate.md
  roadmap: planning/ROADMAP-thinking-gate.md
  date: 2026-07-05
  agents: 8
  panel: "6 core + plan-eng + plan-devex (design/ceo archetype-skipped — no UI). VALIDATES A: eng+devex ran by default without hand-adding."
  verdict: revise
  recommendation: HOLD
  compositeScores: "eng 4.7/10 (5 blocking), devex 5.8/10 (1 blocking)"
  metaFinding: "The corrected 10-agent review caught 5+ blocking defects in a plan BEFORE any code — proving the thinking-gate thesis (earlier review is cheaper) on the thinking-gate plan itself. Note: the hand-run thinking-review returned 'proceed' and missed all of this — the strongest argument BOTH for building the gate with a real synthesis rule + fail-closed router (the very gaps found) AND for multi-altitude review (schema/wave defects are plan-altitude, not framing-altitude)."

agentSummaries[8]{agent,verdict,headline}:
  feature-coverage,revise,"Synthesis/aggregation rule UNDEFINED (biggest gap) — parallel panel findings → one verdict with no rule; a CEO 'wrong problem' finding can be outvoted. Parallel panel NOT gstack's sequenced CEO→Design→Eng cascade (unacknowledged tradeoff). Cross-model second opinion optional/stubbable, second model unnamed (can't be fable). kill untested (fixture accepts 'rewrite OR kill'). No re-review delta after rewrite."
  strategy,proceed-with-fixes,"Right investment, right-sized, M-14 ships differentiator first. But TRIPLE-lens redundancy (same 4 lenses at think-review + roadmap-review + plan-review, never justified). Phase 4 forks 4 agent files vs a mode-param (breaks C-04 minimal-surface). Defer M-16 behind validated M-14. C-03 default-on has no override for a false kill on unattended runs."
  ux,partial,"Verdict is a classification not a directive — no nextAction/recommendedCommand. /loom-auto loop-back unbounded, not persisted/visible. Empty-state (no doc) + --benchmark run-side failure uncovered. Opt-in gate not discoverable. Token drift rewrite-think vs rewrite."
  phasing,revise,"THREE phases own commands/loom-think.md (P1,P2,P5) — self-contradicts lines 30/123. P5 benchmark-check edits review.md it doesn't own. P4/P5 agents lack library.yaml/orchestration.toml registration + model: frontmatter. P0 lacks the archetype→lens SELECTION RULE (only the type). kill should NOT loop. Split P1/P5/P6; promote P3 to own PR."
  parallelization,revise,"P1/P2 loom-think.md collision CONFIRMED (+ self-contradiction). ~/.claude/protocols/pattern-executor.md HOME-path hazard (never enters branch diff). skills/library.yaml registry gap for Wave-2 agents/protocols. Wave 2 (P4/P5) actually disjoint."
  agentic-workflow,revise,"BLOCKER: pattern-executor path is DEAD (~/.claude/protocols empty; real source protocols/pattern-executor.md) AND registering a pattern needs 3 files (pattern-executor + orchestration-patterns + orchestration.toml [patterns.benchmark]+trigger) — else --benchmark is INERT. Subcommand mechanism unspecified: commands/loom-think/review.md gives /loom-think:review FOR FREE (file-based), dissolves P1/P2 collision, avoids breaking the interview entry. skills/loom-auto/** doesn't exist (commands/loom-auto.md ~L113). P5 can't reuse feature-coverage (plan-scoped). Router/marker tests need structural+mocked strategy."
  plan-eng,HOLD,"5 BLOCKING: F-01 P1/P2 collision; F-02 severity is an OPEN enum (router unenforceable) → close to blocking|warning|info; F-03 router fails OPEN (empty/crashed panel → proceed → bypasses the default-on gate) → fail-closed no-quorum→rewrite; F-04 loop-back unbounded + conflates kill(halt) vs rewrite(loop); F-05 P5 edits installed HOME artifact (lost on reinstall, R-001). Composite 4.7. Cites R-001/R-002/R-003."
  plan-devex,revise,"Composite DX 5.8, predictedTTHW 185s, 1 blocking F-01: verdict has no nextCommand. No opt-OUT for /loom-auto default-on. No breaking-change signal. Auto loop no bound/override/audit. Human-path breathing-room thesis honored; automation path under-specifies it."

crossCuttingThemes[8]{theme,raisedBy,severity,resolution}:
  T1-router-underspecified-fails-open,"plan-eng(F-02/F-03/F-07), feature-coverage, phasing, agentic-workflow",blocking,"THE core defect. Close severity enum (blocking|warning|info aligned to AgentResult); define a deterministic SYNTHESIS rule (max-severity drives verdict; any-blocking-wins so no lens is outvoted); FAIL CLOSED — empty/crashed/no-quorum panel → rewrite-think, NEVER proceed (a default-on gate that fails open ships bad ideas); replace 'MAY kill' with a total decision table over (severity × fixability). Extract the mapping into a pure unit for CI-deterministic tests."
  T2-loomthink-md-collision,"structural-precheck, parallelization, phasing, agentic-workflow, plan-eng(F-01)",blocking,"5 agents. Resolve via the file-based subcommand: create commands/loom-think/review.md (→ /loom-think:review FOR FREE) so NO phase edits commands/loom-think.md for dispatch; fold P2 marker work to skills/loom-think/SKILL.md only. Dissolves the collision, the self-contradiction (lines 30/123), AND avoids breaking the /loom-think interview entry's agent: frontmatter."
  T3-auto-loopback-unbounded-kill-conflated,"strategy, ux, feature-coverage, devex, phasing, plan-eng(F-04)",blocking,"6 agents. Bound the loop (rewrite-think → max N iterations, config default ~2, then escalate to operator). kill HALTS with operator handoff — never loops. Add --no-think-review opt-out + --force override for /loom-auto. Persist a LoopBack/Abort state (TOON) with per-attempt verdict+reason for audit + observable test assertion."
  T4-verdict-not-actionable,"ux, devex(blocking F-01), feature-coverage",high,"Add required nextCommand (+ per-finding remediation) to ThinkReviewVerdict: proceed→'/loom-roadmap init'; rewrite-think→'/loom-think --from <doc>'; kill→archive/abandon guidance. Make the verdict a directive, not a label."
  T5-benchmark-plumbing-broken,"parallelization, phasing, agentic-workflow(BLOCKER2), plan-eng(F-05)",blocking,"Repoint to repo protocols/pattern-executor.md (HOME copy is empty/untracked, R-001). --benchmark needs 3-file registration (pattern-executor + orchestration-patterns + orchestration.toml [patterns.benchmark]+trigger) or it's inert. Resolve agent fork to NEW agents/benchmark-agent.md (feature-coverage is plan-scoped, can't run on a bare idea). Register all new agents/protocols in library.yaml + model: frontmatter."
  T6-crossmodel-and-cascade,"feature-coverage",high,"Make the cross-model second opinion MANDATORY in the gate path; name the second model family (non-Claude or a distinct tier, NEVER fable per memory); add divergence handling. Remove P2's 'or resolved/consumed' escape. Decide explicitly on parallel-panel vs gstack's sequenced CEO→Design→Eng cascade (short-circuit + cross-lens flow) — document the tradeoff either way."
  T7-triple-lens-redundancy,"strategy",medium,"Condition the roadmap-review lenses (P3/TG-05) to the HUMAN path (where think-review was skipped, so roadmap-review is the first strategic pass). On /loom-auto (think-review already ran), don't re-run the same 4 lenses at roadmap altitude. Or add an explicit altitude-differentiation note (framing vs roadmap-shape vs plan-detail)."
  T8-schema-and-phasing-hygiene,"plan-eng(F-08/F-10/F-12/F-13), phasing, strategy",medium,"BenchmarkScorecard: type 0..10, gap=self-ref, overall=mean, support N references + sourceRefs[]. P0 owns the archetype→lens selection RULE (not just the type; P1/P3/P4 consume it). Phase 4 → mode-param on existing M-04 agents instead of 4 forked files. Split P6→P6a(auto+loop)/P6b(router+docs). Add P3→P0 dep. Add a changelog/audit step (R-001). Fix critical path to P0→P1→(P4∥P5)→P6."

positives[4]: "Reuse-first architecture is the real strength (no new design-brief schema, reuses .loom/thinks/ crossing artifact + M-04 lenses) — vision is sound, defects are in the router contract + wave partitioning. Doc-first by construction (contracts Wave 0 before command). P3 (roadmap-review lenses) is the model phase — copies the A-fix pattern, cleanly CI-verifiable. Human-path breathing-room thesis genuinely honored (C-01 converged-doc-only + C-03 opt-in)."

prioritizedRevisions[10]{priority,item}:
  1,"Router contract (T1): close severity enum, define synthesis/aggregation rule, FAIL CLOSED on empty/crashed/no-quorum panel, replace MAY with a decision table, extract to a pure testable unit."
  2,"loom-think.md collision (T2): use file-based commands/loom-think/review.md; no dispatch edit; P2 → SKILL.md-only. Fixes collision + self-contradiction + interview-entry risk."
  3,"Auto loop-back (T3): bound rewrite iterations + escalate; kill HALTS not loops; add --no-think-review opt-out + --force + persisted audit state."
  4,"Benchmark plumbing (T5): repo protocols/pattern-executor.md + 3-file pattern registration + new benchmark-agent.md + library.yaml/model: registration for all new agents."
  5,"Verdict actionability (T4): add nextCommand + per-finding remediation to ThinkReviewVerdict."
  6,"Cross-model + cascade (T6): mandatory named second model (not fable) + divergence handling; decide+document parallel-vs-sequenced."
  7,"Triple-lens redundancy (T7): condition roadmap-review lenses to the human path; add altitude-differentiation note."
  8,"BenchmarkScorecard schema + P0 archetype-selection rule + Phase-4 mode-param instead of 4 forked agents (T8)."
  9,"Split P6→P6a/P6b; fix critical path P0→P1→(P4∥P5)→P6; add P3→P0 dep; add changelog/audit step (R-001)."
  10,"Test strategy: structural + mocked-router units (CI-deterministic) + a fixture that must route specifically to kill; empty-state + benchmark-run-failure coverage."
